"file_name": "Screenshot_01.png", "id": "592548107193274", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312039_592548110526607_3935699260706373165_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Eq9j0LBONVcQ7kNvwELsnFP&_nc_oc=AdpvT0lS0f8x1q-ldGx9BtXNBFolQjWHEtqTYsIEfmfskddEB_FhEW6fkPFwuv-VGEk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRX5sDQisxIZLt1wEhri0xBu8VTD_fIrXTSapvAgmAzAQ&oe=6B005E31"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_02.png", "id": "1619317862081222", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299789_1619317865414555_4715324583631629272_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4Vl40BSJwSwQ7kNvwFDM5gb&_nc_oc=Adrh3YUx1GyDYfwWw2bhQMpWSVyXqoc_qWueqspm1zLZTLlPxJnpSsFDZsyx6JKHW2E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSbh6QOdwaYB4xW2zQf9LFfHgJYwzj6-qFOaH_GqwNzyw&oe=6B007461"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Meta_CoverArt_Landscape.png", "id": "2759913480870229", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312454_2759913484203562_3844212442751558475_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WXjU2zCEKZ4Q7kNvwFthZPG&_nc_oc=Adr-jTNTbYesmxqsz9FCRTHbmC3SqgO71oiJBp8ZWDg7cK7xW0RsNpTag40mXEacGlw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQZJHeU8SkoZpDMW45oNtY_qgvkbNMHeGkFSnrAfzeUaA&oe=6B005CFA"}, "display_name": "The Minigames Game", "keywords": ["party", "minigame", "friends"], "long_description": "**The Minigames Game is a multiplayer Virtual Reality collection of Minigames for up to 12 players. The game offers a wide variety of minigames catering to different Virtual Reality mechanics.**\n\n# ONLINE MULTIPLAYER\n\nRuin Friendships with up to 11 of your friends from the comfort of your own home. You can also decide to be nice, but who wants that? \n\n# TOURNAMENT MODE\n\nPlay minigames with your friends in a tournament format, battling it out until the end. Collect epic companions in between minigames to flex your exploration skills.\n\n# MINIGAME MODE\n\nDon't want to commit to a tournament? The Minigames Game provides ways to spend 5 minutes or 5 hours without commitment. Jump into the minigame mode to play whatever you wish.\n\n# LEADERBOARDS\n\nClimb to the top in all of our highscore and speedrun minigames. \n", "short_description": "The Minigames Game is a multiplayer Virtual Reality collection of Minigames for up to 12 players. Ruin Friendships in a wide variety of minigames from the comfort of your own home."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tmg.vuturia.de/datenschutz/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VUTURIA", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tmg.vuturia.de/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1700921480735423"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "de"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "24865197889824263"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296201_9682624181849311_59945643561143835_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p3yAV2iI45QQ7kNvwGtWWIp&_nc_oc=AdpK4voSAUibJNscIoAAzVYa6Ejrr5azW0liZ9jswLrqUnUa_6gq2QKfOVgIpAVhc6s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQghQxFl8Ar6haJaoQo_RnRApREJaoLEsTd65zcxhd9hA&o